90:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"(10) Any mitigating circumstances.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"07a49ec1-c2b0-5e4e-ae84-41cf86569911"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","content_hash":"28c6a4d8a983fd773830fe747754fde57698cf82033bb74addaee6bbe0b0d9bb","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:11","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"(b) The City Attorney shall not enter into a diversion agreement in lieu of further criminal proceedings on a complaint alleging an alcohol-related offense if the defendant:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4c18d3e5-19ad-5882-988a-8c17fa2007d0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","content_hash":"1c4bd6972d3aa0297ecbdeac4d6d0959cbd3a9e370d043861d25fe882932a44d","heading":null,"ordinal":12,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:12","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"(1) Has previously participated in diversion of an alcohol-related offense;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e29cd64c-c241-583e-a653-591b1f66c25a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","content_hash":"b3c46627eabcffdffe400e2f3ba994f3bfd3d69e157aad994ddbf5cdb41cac21","heading":null,"ordinal":13,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:13","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"(2) Has previously been convicted of or pleaded nolo contendere to an alcohol-related offense in this State or has previously been convicted of or pleaded nolo contendere to a violation of K.S.A. 8-1567 and amendments thereto or of a law of another state, or of a political subdivision thereof, which prohibits the acts prohibited by that statute; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4efc2a21-4798-5a32-9408-6a14ab31f2e9"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","content_hash":"120c17cdb9338e269a86ac5f1cecdc4b373cafb3fbce8259e79cda8632a9db50","heading":null,"ordinal":14,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:14","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"(3) During the time of the alleged alcohol-related offense was involved in a motor vehicle accident or collision resulting in personal injury or death. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 51, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-86. Formerly 2.110.490.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2fe5c801-2ed7-5701-b75e-d26483a5ebb7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","content_hash":"9427e76a16ae2877613e38063c3cd7c0f91a6f3827133cb8e073bce139d33a7f","heading":null,"ordinal":15,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:15","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"Cross References: City Attorney, TMC 2.20.070 ; Police Department, TMC 2.20.090 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b37059c0-be3b-5534-928e-96338bd26df1"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","content_hash":"83269a49329d3cd6aa0c8442da52db18db7428d6792e69dbf15600abad86e9af","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.490","text":"State Law References: Similar State statute, K.S.A. 12-4415 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b22e5f34-395f-533c-ba1a-57439549b7cd"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}